WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.833
"JC Staff Excel Saga Conference Room"

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:10.125
Rejected! You can't do this!

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:13.083
Then what're we going to do?!
I'm out of ideas!

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:17.000
Damn it, I spent four
whole days writing this plot!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.375
Fine! Then this'll be okay, right?!

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:23.292
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:00:23.292 --> 00:00:24.792
Okay!

00:00:35.625 --> 00:00:39.500
<i>Sore wa ai ja nai</i>

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.417
<i>Ai wa sore ja nai</i>

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:51.292
<i>Aishite iru kedo aisarete wa inai</i>

00:00:51.292 --> 00:00:55.167
<i>Kesshite ai ja nai</i>

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:59.250
<i>Ketsu wa ai ja nai</i>

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:06.958
<i>Aisaretai keredo motometari wa shinai</i>

00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:11.708
<i>Kono mi sasagete inochi nagedashi</i>

00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:15.750
<i>Wakime mo furazu tada hitasura ni</i>

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:19.667
<i>Damashite sukashite yokohairi</i>

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:22.875
<i>Tanin o fumitaoshi keri o kamashite</i>

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:25.042
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:25.042 --> 00:01:26.958
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:28.833
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:30.750
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:35.583
<i>Banana no kawa de korondemo</i>

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:38.708
<i>Sore wa subete ano kata no tame</i>

00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:43.333
<i>Shiite iu nara sore wa kitto</i>

00:01:43.333 --> 00:01:51.167
<i>Ai to iu na no chuuseishin</i>

00:01:58.208 --> 00:02:01.625
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:02.667
Zzo...

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:06.750
It's fine that the tension is
high and low today, as always, but...

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:09.917
Now, our idealistic organization ACROSS,

00:02:09.917 --> 00:02:12.917
which exists in order
to establish an ideal world,

00:02:12.917 --> 00:02:16.167
is making progress albeit little by little.

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:18.583
This means one thing and one thing only,

00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:21.000
that the substance of your past activities

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.917
has been effective towards
reaching the goal before us,

00:02:23.917 --> 00:02:25.417
the conquest of this city.

00:02:25.417 --> 00:02:27.750
Is this true, Lord Ilpalazzo?

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.750
We did it, didn't we, Senior?

00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:33.292
Being praised so much, when all
we did was just sort of run errands,

00:02:33.292 --> 00:02:35.958
our actions up to now
look somewhat meaningless,

00:02:35.958 --> 00:02:37.625
but that's that and this is this.

00:02:37.625 --> 00:02:40.958
That really hits the spot.
I'm honestly happy!

00:02:40.958 --> 00:02:44.125
Lucky! Happy! And look that way!

00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:46.792
I want to praise myself!

00:02:46.792 --> 00:02:50.042
After all, bad things are over
once you forget about them.

00:02:50.792 --> 00:02:54.500
However, while we are pushing
towards our ideal in some areas,

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.500
it is true that we
are retreating in others.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:02.125
With your permission,
may I ask what that means?

00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:04.208
Take three steps forward
and two steps back?

00:03:04.208 --> 00:03:06.208
Or round we go and cats eyes?

00:03:06.208 --> 00:03:08.875
Oh, or, like going
backwards on an escalator?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:15.208
The bottom! There's no bottom!

00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:17.583
How deep is this?

00:03:17.583 --> 00:03:21.583
Some part-timers are currently
making progress on the depth.

00:03:24.167 --> 00:03:25.500
We're digging!

00:03:26.875 --> 00:03:29.042
This is the fifth time, Sir.

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:32.875
I may be a genius, but when
they are destroyed so often,

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:36.000
of course, even I will be
at a loss to respond.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.417
You must have heard about
the series of bomb incidents.

00:03:39.417 --> 00:03:41.375
Ah, that?

00:03:41.375 --> 00:03:43.833
I would love to deal with it,

00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:47.667
but both precision and strength
are far from what I desired.

00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:49.667
Especially with regard
to their personalities.

00:03:49.667 --> 00:03:51.792
This city is being targeted!

00:03:51.792 --> 00:03:54.208
Oh-ho, the secret society, is it?

00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:56.292
Yes, the secret society.

00:03:56.292 --> 00:03:58.375
In that case, I guess I have no choice.

00:03:58.375 --> 00:04:01.500
Then I will finish them up by
keeping your requests in mind,

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.208
as well as the emotional aspects.

00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:06.208
How long do you think it will take?

00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:09.250
In five minutes. Goodbye.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.542
Mina-<i>chan</i>?

00:04:11.542 --> 00:04:13.042
Missed!

00:04:16.542 --> 00:04:18.375
"Nabe-Nabe Express"

00:04:23.458 --> 00:04:27.875
'Ello! Nabe-Nabe Express!
We're here to deliver your package!

00:04:27.875 --> 00:04:28.875
We're here.

00:04:28.875 --> 00:04:31.208
But Hatchan, isn't this...

00:04:31.208 --> 00:04:31.875
Yes.

00:04:31.875 --> 00:04:34.208
This is our apartment, right?

00:04:34.208 --> 00:04:35.208
Right.

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:36.708
Is this being lazy or what?

00:04:36.708 --> 00:04:38.583
Perhaps they were short on settings?

00:04:38.583 --> 00:04:39.708
"Art Director"
"Junichi Higashi"

00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:42.417
But it is nice that our
trip home will be easy.

00:04:42.417 --> 00:04:45.583
Oh, well.
Back to work, back to work.

00:04:45.583 --> 00:04:47.792
Driver, unload the package!

00:04:47.792 --> 00:04:50.000
Okay, coming right up.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.333
Push.

00:04:57.917 --> 00:04:59.750
Package!

00:05:02.417 --> 00:05:04.750
Wha-What just happened?

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:17.583
The base subject?!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:23.042
H-H-H-Hatchan!
This is one tremendous move!

00:05:42.458 --> 00:05:45.667
Er, hello? Hello?

00:05:47.125 --> 00:05:51.083
They've like made a world of
their own and I can't get in, right?

00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:53.458
Big Sister!

00:05:53.458 --> 00:05:55.375
Am I paired with you?

00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:57.292
"It's called imprinting."

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.042
A-A human bomb!

00:06:01.042 --> 00:06:04.000
I'll put away my
oddly biased my-knowledge

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:08.042
into the in-my-heart locker
that's 100 meters to the rear!

00:06:08.042 --> 00:06:10.292
Na-Na-Na-Nabeshin!

00:06:10.292 --> 00:06:13.125
And he's disappeared
while he was off the screen!

00:06:13.125 --> 00:06:17.375
Senior, will we be
receiving our daily wage?

00:06:17.375 --> 00:06:19.333
But my person was in danger!

00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:19.708
--Come back, Nabeshin!

00:06:19.708 --> 00:06:21.833
--Oh, Sister!
--Come back, Nabeshin!

00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:24.667
But there's already not a trace of him left.

00:06:24.667 --> 00:06:26.375
Big Sister!

00:06:26.375 --> 00:06:28.292
Don't go!

00:06:28.292 --> 00:06:29.167
Big Sister!

00:06:29.167 --> 00:06:30.958
I'm gonna die. Hey.

00:06:30.958 --> 00:06:34.667
Oh, Senior, I too... death...

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:41.667
I'm Excel and this is Hyatt,
so our introduction is concluded.

00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:46.708
Would you at least
tell big sis your names?

00:06:47.458 --> 00:06:50.000
If you don't answer,
we'll turn you into new Sailor Scouts

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.167
and do a parody
in the next episode!

00:06:52.167 --> 00:06:55.000
Senior, the script is already done.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.167
Oh, right.

00:06:56.167 --> 00:06:58.042
More importantly...

00:06:58.042 --> 00:06:59.875
That's my Hatchan!

00:06:59.875 --> 00:07:02.292
All we have to do
is return these nameless,

00:07:02.292 --> 00:07:04.708
mysterious base
subjects to the sender...

00:07:04.708 --> 00:07:06.917
But it's not written down!

00:07:06.917 --> 00:07:09.167
But in the contents area...

00:07:09.167 --> 00:07:12.042
I got it! I comprehend!
I understand!

00:07:12.042 --> 00:07:14.542
I've discovered your true identities!

00:07:14.542 --> 00:07:19.167
Your true identities are
right here-ere-ere-ere-ere!

00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:22.167
Was the echo okay?

00:07:22.167 --> 00:07:22.375
--Roger that.

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:23.542
--Input completed. I understand, Sister Excel!
--Roger that.

00:07:23.542 --> 00:07:25.917
--Input completed. I understand, Sister Excel!
--Pleased to meet you, Miss Ropponmatsu.

00:07:25.917 --> 00:07:26.417
--Input completed. I understand, Sister Excel!
--Yes, Miss Hyatt.

00:07:26.417 --> 00:07:28.042
--Yay, yay! My name is Ropponmatsu!
--Yes, Miss Hyatt.

00:07:28.042 --> 00:07:29.750
--Yay, yay! My name is Ropponmatsu!
--Would you like some hot water?

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:29.917
--It's the name Sister gave me! Yay! Yay!
--Would you like some hot water?

00:07:29.917 --> 00:07:33.292
--It's the name Sister gave me! Yay! Yay!
--Thank you.

00:07:33.292 --> 00:07:37.042
Lord Ilpalazzo, the situation
is steadily going downhill.

00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:45.708
Yay, it's a mutt! It's cute!

00:07:45.708 --> 00:07:48.417
Menchi is being saved
for an emergency situation,

00:07:48.417 --> 00:07:50.417
so you better not be
mean to her, you little runt.

00:07:50.417 --> 00:07:52.083
My name is Ropponmatsu.

00:07:52.083 --> 00:07:54.708
If you need someone
to cook, please let me know.

00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:57.125
I'll count on you, when the time comes.

00:07:57.125 --> 00:07:58.750
Oh, she died.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:02.333
Say, Hatchan, you think
they're planning on staying here?

00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:04.167
It should be lively, won't it?

00:08:04.167 --> 00:08:05.708
That isn't what I meant!

00:08:05.708 --> 00:08:07.125
Excuse me.

00:08:07.125 --> 00:08:10.167
Is there anything I can help with?

00:08:10.167 --> 00:08:12.625
After all, we will be
in your care from now on.

00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:14.542
And they're already planning on it!

00:08:14.542 --> 00:08:15.958
But still...

00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:18.792
W-We don't have anything,
so there's nothing to clean.

00:08:18.792 --> 00:08:22.792
And we are rather lacking in
ingredients for cooking.

00:08:22.792 --> 00:08:25.292
Does that mean this is
an emergency situation?

00:08:25.292 --> 00:08:26.708
Hey, she's convulsing.

00:08:26.708 --> 00:08:29.625
I-In any case, we don't need any help.

00:08:29.625 --> 00:08:33.042
You guys are package-people
that were in the packages,

00:08:33.042 --> 00:08:35.708
so the obvious thing is for
you to go back to the sender, right?

00:08:35.708 --> 00:08:38.958
But this apartment was the destination.

00:08:38.958 --> 00:08:41.125
She's explained it away so logically!

00:08:41.125 --> 00:08:43.542
So this is a meeting of fate!

00:08:43.542 --> 00:08:46.125
Don't try to explain
it away psychologically!

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:47.625
Hatchan!

00:08:48.833 --> 00:08:52.292
Th-Their level of understanding
is progressing?!

00:08:52.292 --> 00:08:53.083
What is it?!

00:08:53.083 --> 00:08:54.833
It's a man's picture!

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:56.583
You little brat,
what d'you think you're doing?!

00:08:56.583 --> 00:08:58.917
I'm not a brat, I'm Ropponmatsu.

00:08:58.917 --> 00:09:02.042
I don't care if it's six sticks,
a social finch, or miserable!

00:09:02.042 --> 00:09:05.208
How dare you pick up the
picture of holy Lord Ilpalazzo?!

00:09:05.208 --> 00:09:07.750
He wouldn't happen to
be your boyfriend, would he?

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:11.125
He looks cool, so he'd
be perfect for you, Big Sister.

00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:12.292
You think so?

00:09:12.292 --> 00:09:16.542
But why are you not in
the picture with this man?

00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:16.958
"Wham"

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:18.333
I'm gonna hit you!

00:09:18.333 --> 00:09:21.333
Don't say that after you've hit me!

00:09:21.333 --> 00:09:24.958
I got it! You're short-tempered
because you're hungry!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:29.500
If that is the case,
let us go obtain foodstuffs.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.542
But we have almost no money.

00:09:32.542 --> 00:09:34.750
And we didn't get our daily wage either.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.292
It doesn't matter!

00:09:36.792 --> 00:09:39.083
Hatchan, they're good kids, aren't they?

00:09:39.083 --> 00:09:40.583
Aren't they, though?

00:09:50.542 --> 00:09:53.708
Why are they wearing those uniforms?

00:09:53.708 --> 00:09:57.708
And I'm pretty sure the
girl on the right is Watanabe's...

00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:00.958
I better not get involved.

00:10:03.542 --> 00:10:05.417
So they have imprinting?

00:10:05.417 --> 00:10:06.750
Yes,

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:10.333
they will love the first life form
they see the moment they awaken.

00:10:10.333 --> 00:10:13.833
I have built that feature
into the initial settings of their AI.

00:10:13.833 --> 00:10:16.625
Please use the same principles
as a dating simulation game

00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:19.542
to raise them into the kind of
women you would like them to be.

00:10:20.125 --> 00:10:21.583
I understand that,

00:10:21.583 --> 00:10:23.917
but the all-important
Ropponmatsu Models 1 and 2

00:10:23.917 --> 00:10:25.917
have not been delivered yet.

00:10:25.917 --> 00:10:29.917
You are always precise about time,
but they're already three hours late!

00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:31.250
You must be joking.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:35.375
I shipped them out exactly three
hours and five minutes ago.

00:10:35.375 --> 00:10:36.625
And the destination?

00:10:36.625 --> 00:10:41.000
The apartment they
are to live in, of course.

00:10:46.083 --> 00:10:49.750
Episode 16. Something
will start happening soon.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.083
No, it had better, or else...

00:10:55.125 --> 00:10:59.125
Ms. Will, I'm still embedded in pudding!

00:10:59.125 --> 00:11:02.500
Aside from that,
where are you taking me?

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:06.333
We will return to your
homeland and take revenge

00:11:06.333 --> 00:11:10.500
upon the darling son and
sexy wife that betrayed you,

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:13.625
and upon Gomez, your friend
that stole everything away from you.

00:11:13.625 --> 00:11:14.625
Let's go!

00:11:14.625 --> 00:11:15.958
No!

00:11:15.958 --> 00:11:20.500
They're so rash! Right now,
they're still... They're still...

00:11:25.667 --> 00:11:28.208
Flight attendant!

00:11:28.208 --> 00:11:29.542
Fire!

00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:32.292
"Oh!"

00:11:35.917 --> 00:11:38.333
But I wanted to try flying!

00:11:57.375 --> 00:11:59.792
Oh, gorgeous, gorgeous.

00:11:59.792 --> 00:12:03.958
By the way, why are we in a park
instead of a restaurant?

00:12:03.958 --> 00:12:09.417
Upon scanning, I found Miss Hyatt
to be not in the best of health,

00:12:09.417 --> 00:12:13.292
so I thought it would be better
to dine amidst fresh air.

00:12:13.292 --> 00:12:15.833
Thank you very much for
your solicitousness.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:23.625
Well, there seems to
be a dangerous mood here

00:12:23.625 --> 00:12:25.875
that might cause lilies
to blossom wildly,

00:12:25.875 --> 00:12:28.542
but I guess it's okay.
After all, the food is good.

00:12:28.542 --> 00:12:30.292
Yay! Yay!

00:12:30.292 --> 00:12:31.042
--But still, can't anything be
done about this hopping-girl?!

00:12:31.042 --> 00:12:33.750
--Sister Excel praised me!
--But still, can't anything be done

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:33.875
--Ropponmatsu is so happy!
--about this hopping-girl?!

00:12:33.875 --> 00:12:35.292
--Ropponmatsu is so happy!
--She is just so <i>noisy</i>!

00:12:35.292 --> 00:12:35.792
--Ropponmatsu is so happy!
--Senior, isn't it wonderful

00:12:35.792 --> 00:12:36.583
--I'm really, really happy! So happy!
--Senior, isn't it wonderful

00:12:36.583 --> 00:12:39.542
--I'm really, really happy! So happy!
--that we can watch television in a park...

00:12:39.542 --> 00:12:40.083
--I'm really, really happy! So happy!
--Yeah, I get the feeling that

00:12:40.083 --> 00:12:42.417
--the power cord is sort of connected

00:12:42.417 --> 00:12:45.083
to that hopping-girl there, but...

00:12:45.083 --> 00:12:46.583
Could it be human power generation?

00:12:46.583 --> 00:12:48.792
Would you please
call me by my name already?!

00:12:48.792 --> 00:12:50.083
Would you like anything else?

00:12:50.083 --> 00:12:51.875
Oh, no, nothing in particular.

00:12:51.875 --> 00:12:53.667
Number three, Iguchi, has made a hit!

00:12:53.667 --> 00:12:54.833
--It's their seventh run this inning!

00:12:54.833 --> 00:12:57.250
--Man, the Onions are losing again.
--It's their seventh run this inning!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:57.833
--Man, the Onions are losing again.
--Nagai of the Onions...

00:12:57.833 --> 00:12:59.792
They're so weak, it's sad.

00:12:59.792 --> 00:13:03.167
I feel so sorry for them,
I wish they'd win once in a while.

00:13:03.167 --> 00:13:04.583
I agree.

00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:06.250
Please leave it to me.

00:13:06.917 --> 00:13:09.583
She ran off at an incredible
speed for some reason.

00:13:09.583 --> 00:13:11.292
Perhaps she went to pick flowers.

00:13:11.292 --> 00:13:13.250
File your taxes! Sooner the better!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.750
It'll be awful if you don't!
I'm gonna hit you!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.125
Our rent is due tomorrow, isn't it?

00:13:18.125 --> 00:13:20.542
What should we do, Hatchan?

00:13:26.083 --> 00:13:27.458
Stop!

00:13:27.458 --> 00:13:30.583
You don't have to think about it anymore!
You don't have to worry!

00:13:30.583 --> 00:13:32.333
Health before poverty!

00:13:32.333 --> 00:13:34.958
Tomorrow will come
as long as you're alive!

00:13:34.958 --> 00:13:38.583
Sister Excel!

00:13:39.583 --> 00:13:41.875
Tada!

00:13:41.875 --> 00:13:45.542
Ha-Hatchan, how many months'
worth of rent do you think this is?

00:13:45.542 --> 00:13:48.375
We'll be able to get pickled
vegetables with our beef bowls.

00:13:48.375 --> 00:13:50.958
I gathered up as much as I could!

00:13:50.958 --> 00:13:52.167
Gathered?

00:13:52.167 --> 00:13:54.000
--Praise me, praise me, praise me!

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.875
--Hatchan, I don't want to dwell on this too much,
--Praise me, praise me, praise me!

00:13:56.875 --> 00:13:58.625
--so let's escape from reality with television.
--Praise me, praise me, praise me!

00:13:58.625 --> 00:14:02.250
--so let's escape from reality with television.
--Praise me, me! Oh, please praise me!

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.208
It's a home run! A home run!

00:14:04.208 --> 00:14:05.958
The relief pitcher
and pinch hitter, Okamoto,

00:14:05.958 --> 00:14:07.750
has hit an unexpected
home run with bases loaded!

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:11.792
He is rounding the bases in
a frail manner for some reason!

00:14:11.792 --> 00:14:14.083
Ha-Ha-Ha-Hatchan, look! Look!

00:14:14.083 --> 00:14:16.792
It's Miss Ropponmatsu, isn't it?

00:14:16.792 --> 00:14:19.000
I was right. It's not a hallucination.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.667
I'm Ropponmatsu too!

00:14:20.667 --> 00:14:22.375
Yeah, yeah, you're right.

00:14:23.042 --> 00:14:24.792
We are interrupting
your regular programming

00:14:24.792 --> 00:14:26.958
to bring you a special newscast.

00:14:26.958 --> 00:14:31.708
Around 3 PM today, a burglary
occurred at the JC Bank in F City.

00:14:31.708 --> 00:14:35.667
1.2 billion yen in cash was stolen.

00:14:35.667 --> 00:14:39.333
The police have mobilized
over 7000 criminal investigators

00:14:39.333 --> 00:14:41.500
and are doing everything in
their power to arrest the perpetrators

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.833
by expanding the investigation
to all areas of F City.

00:14:43.833 --> 00:14:45.875
Furthermore, these
perpetrators resemble the thieves

00:14:45.875 --> 00:14:48.000
who stole food
items from a supermarket

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.250
before the burglary in the same area.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:55.750
The police have concluded
that the two cases are related.

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:58.292
They are sending out emergency
warrants for the suspects

00:14:58.292 --> 00:15:01.667
that were caught on the security
camera at the supermarket.

00:15:01.667 --> 00:15:05.042
Oh, they got a good picture of me!

00:15:05.042 --> 00:15:06.000
--They're exactly alike.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.208
--It probably is them.
--They're exactly alike.

00:15:09.042 --> 00:15:11.042
And everyone's disappeared!

00:15:13.542 --> 00:15:16.375
Due to the unilateral and quick to
act state power's misunderstanding,

00:15:16.375 --> 00:15:19.667
my fate is very much in a fix!

00:15:19.667 --> 00:15:21.333
Senior, calm down.

00:15:21.333 --> 00:15:25.042
Don't worry, Big Sister. I'll do my best.

00:15:25.042 --> 00:15:28.583
I won't forgive anyone
that would hurt Big Sister!

00:15:33.583 --> 00:15:34.583
See?

00:15:34.583 --> 00:15:36.583
Don't “see” me!
What're you doing, you little runt?!

00:15:36.583 --> 00:15:37.750
I'm gonna hit you!

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:41.792
Please say that before you hit me!
And I'm Ropponmatsu!

00:15:41.792 --> 00:15:43.167
Senior?

00:15:45.958 --> 00:15:47.792
We've been determined
to be accomplices!

00:15:47.792 --> 00:15:49.792
Magnification one and go!

00:16:02.375 --> 00:16:03.917
Beam!

00:16:17.458 --> 00:16:21.042
To the suspects!
You are completely surrounded!

00:16:21.042 --> 00:16:25.083
Throw down your weapons
and surrender quietly!

00:16:25.083 --> 00:16:29.958
So this is our flight of love,
just the two of us.

00:16:29.958 --> 00:16:32.458
There are three people here.
There are <i>three </i>people here!

00:16:32.458 --> 00:16:35.292
Say, Hatchan,
can't we do something about her?

00:16:36.083 --> 00:16:39.958
Might you be expecting some
kind of dangerous development?

00:16:39.958 --> 00:16:41.458
Big Sister!

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:46.375
A single red rose being picked by force!

00:16:46.375 --> 00:16:48.625
Face heavily damaged!
Upper right arm area injured!

00:16:48.625 --> 00:16:50.625
Nape slightly damaged!
Right thigh area lost!

00:16:50.625 --> 00:16:52.542
Heavy weight on abdominal region!
Contortion developed!

00:16:52.542 --> 00:16:53.792
Third bridge out of commission!

00:16:53.792 --> 00:16:57.583
Pheromone energy in
entire body at 120 percent!

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:08.042
That was refreshing!

00:17:08.042 --> 00:17:12.625
I-I feel like I've lost all
sorts of things all at once.

00:17:12.625 --> 00:17:16.125
Hey! Quit ignoring us and
broadcasting such indecency!

00:17:16.125 --> 00:17:17.500
Hurry up and surrender!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.833
Shut up, state power!

00:17:19.833 --> 00:17:21.625
Don't agitate them!

00:17:21.625 --> 00:17:22.958
Okay.

00:17:28.417 --> 00:17:29.417
That hurt!

00:17:29.417 --> 00:17:31.208
Why are you alive?!

00:17:31.208 --> 00:17:33.125
The sniper has failed, Sir!

00:17:33.125 --> 00:17:34.500
How could that be?!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.917
Since it's come to this,
mobilize the super-SWAT!

00:17:36.917 --> 00:17:37.833
Sir?

00:17:37.833 --> 00:17:39.833
Oh, that really hurt.

00:17:39.833 --> 00:17:43.500
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why is your life safe?

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.583
Y-Y-Y-You're a robot?!

00:17:45.583 --> 00:17:47.333
You hadn't noticed?

00:17:47.333 --> 00:17:49.000
No human can fire
missiles from their knees

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.458
and beams from their eyes.

00:17:51.458 --> 00:17:53.167
Come to think of it, you're right.

00:17:53.167 --> 00:17:54.375
Oh? Hatchan?

00:17:54.375 --> 00:17:56.042
Miss Hyatt!

00:17:56.042 --> 00:17:57.458
Are you all right?

00:17:57.458 --> 00:17:57.875
--Hey, you stepped on me. And robots are heavy...

00:17:57.875 --> 00:18:01.042
--Miss Ropponmatsu...
--Hey, you stepped on me. And robots are heavy...

00:18:01.042 --> 00:18:04.792
The Fukuoka Onions won from
behind in the bottom of the ninth.

00:18:04.792 --> 00:18:08.250
Did you see my home run?

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:11.375
You had wonderful form.

00:18:12.625 --> 00:18:14.750
And she dies again already!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:17.375
It will be okay.
I will do something about it.

00:18:17.375 --> 00:18:20.042
Doing something is fine,
but I wish you'd get off me.

00:18:20.042 --> 00:18:23.167
I will give my life to Miss Hyatt.

00:18:23.167 --> 00:18:24.500
How?

00:18:26.708 --> 00:18:28.917
Miss Hyatt, live! Live!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.083
A-And they're doing
some kind of virtual SFX!

00:18:36.917 --> 00:18:38.917
Live! Live!

00:18:41.208 --> 00:18:41.875
"Heaven"
"Right over there"

00:18:41.875 --> 00:18:44.542
Come on,
what are ya doing?! Move it!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.000
Give it back!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.583
Now I understand how Senior feels!

00:18:53.917 --> 00:18:55.083
I...

00:18:55.625 --> 00:18:57.708
What a forced plot twist.

00:18:57.708 --> 00:19:03.333
Miss Ropponmatsu burnt out her
own life in order to save Miss Hyatt.

00:19:03.333 --> 00:19:04.875
You mean overheated, right?

00:19:04.875 --> 00:19:07.375
Miss Ropponmatsu,
you were admirable.

00:19:07.375 --> 00:19:11.458
How the heck do you pass
life between a robot and a human?

00:19:12.917 --> 00:19:13.917
Damn it!

00:19:13.917 --> 00:19:15.833
Right when people are dying and
breaking and having a tough time,

00:19:15.833 --> 00:19:18.500
how dare you fire in
something so dangerous?!

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:20.292
Little one, get them!

00:19:20.292 --> 00:19:21.333
I'm outta ammo.

00:19:21.333 --> 00:19:23.125
That's not good.

00:19:27.125 --> 00:19:31.375
Hatchan, you came back to
life all this way, but we're done for!

00:19:31.375 --> 00:19:34.417
You tell me this,
but I still cannot quite believe...

00:19:34.417 --> 00:19:38.625
You can swallow it or chew it
up, but what's done for is done for!

00:19:39.625 --> 00:19:41.792
I see! Now is the time!

00:19:42.583 --> 00:19:43.583
Wait!

00:19:43.583 --> 00:19:47.917
Right, now is the time.
Now is the time! This is my destiny!

00:19:51.458 --> 00:19:53.833
But I won't have any regrets.

00:19:58.333 --> 00:19:59.333
It's one of the suspects!

00:19:59.333 --> 00:20:02.917
All right! Shoot and shoot
and shoot the hell out of her!

00:20:04.458 --> 00:20:07.917
<i>All I can do right now</i>
<i>is burn out my own life!</i>

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:12.958
Generator, maximum output!

00:20:15.667 --> 00:20:22.000
Big Sister Excel, I...
I was happy to have met you.

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:25.667
It was only a short time,
but I was very, very...

00:20:31.208 --> 00:20:33.833
No, no, there weren't
any scenes like that.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:41.667
Ropponmatsu!

00:20:41.667 --> 00:20:47.875
Big Si-ster, first time...
by my name... I'm so happy...

00:20:47.875 --> 00:20:52.875
Ropponmatsu, give back
my emergency food supply!

00:20:57.125 --> 00:21:00.042
I can't believe those are
the last words I'll ever hear!

00:21:00.042 --> 00:21:03.125
Big Sister, you're so mean!

00:21:04.333 --> 00:21:11.833
Menchi! And also, Ropponmatsu!

00:21:11.833 --> 00:21:13.292
Menchi!

00:21:14.708 --> 00:21:16.917
I'm so glad, Menchi.

00:21:20.917 --> 00:21:22.417
Little one...

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:31.875
Today was pretty
dangerous all day, wasn't it?

00:21:31.875 --> 00:21:34.125
But I'm so glad Menchi is safe.

00:21:36.083 --> 00:21:40.417
I was shocked to learn that
the Ropponmatsus were robots.

00:21:40.417 --> 00:21:41.708
Yeah.

00:21:41.708 --> 00:21:45.083
Maybe it would've been okay to
let them stay, since they were robots.

00:21:45.083 --> 00:21:47.250
They were useful in their own way.

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:49.125
Senior?

00:21:49.125 --> 00:21:51.250
What shall we do about the rent?

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.708
Tomorrow is another day.
It'll work out somehow.

00:21:54.708 --> 00:21:56.333
You are right.

00:21:56.333 --> 00:21:57.458
<i>Unobserved,</i>

00:21:57.458 --> 00:22:00.167
<i>the Ropponmatsus sacrificed</i>
<i>themselves for love and died.</i>

00:22:00.167 --> 00:22:05.208
<i>They dashed through a time</i>
<i>that was too short to be called youth.</i>

00:22:05.208 --> 00:22:12.000
<i>But there were none who</i>
<i>understood their noble hearts.</i>

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:15.167
<i>Not that it would matter</i>
<i>if there were any...</i>

00:22:15.167 --> 00:22:17.125
<i>But, hey, hey!</i>

00:22:17.125 --> 00:22:18.792
<i>They're alive!</i>

00:22:20.625 --> 00:22:25.208
"Episode 16: Take Back Love!"

00:22:25.208 --> 00:22:27.042
"Episode 16: Take Back Love!"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:27.042 --> 00:22:28.875
"Episode 16: Take Back Love!"
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:50.917 --> 00:22:59.333
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.333 --> 00:23:06.750
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:14.833 --> 00:23:23.625
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.583 --> 00:23:32.375
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.375 --> 00:23:40.250
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:48.125
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.125 --> 00:23:56.875
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:59.083 --> 00:24:00.250
Anime is the greatest
of all pleasures!

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:02.417
Young and old, everyone loves anime!
We're all raised on anime!

00:24:02.417 --> 00:24:04.458
Japanese culture that we can
boast to the world! That is anime!

00:24:04.458 --> 00:24:05.542
Sounds sort of sinister. After all,

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:07.542
Japanese anime is hugely
popular even in the great America!

00:24:07.542 --> 00:24:09.042
Even Japanese authors
go to America and Hawaii

00:24:09.042 --> 00:24:11.542
and get pampered to death
with busty babes waiting on them.

00:24:11.542 --> 00:24:13.958
That's what you call worldwide. No, really!

00:24:13.958 --> 00:24:15.250
Anime is good! Anime is the best!

00:24:15.250 --> 00:24:17.333
We want you to work hard to
become the big creators of tomorrow!

00:24:17.333 --> 00:24:19.792
We are absolutely serious!
But a bit of it is a lie.

00:24:19.792 --> 00:24:20.917
So, we've taken an Excel-ish look

00:24:20.917 --> 00:24:22.750
at the animation being
produced in this recession.

00:24:22.750 --> 00:24:24.583
Quack Experimental Animation,
Excel Saga, the menace!

00:24:24.583 --> 00:24:28.552
Next time, "Animation USA." Viva America!
